{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/124484","id":4862472210,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABIdNwEg","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124484","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124484.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124484.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124484","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/124484/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/124484/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124484/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/101afac9f3ad61699a07a866c4456ce593b8b461","number":124484,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Fix particle material UBO binding in GLES3 Compatibility renderer","user":{"login":"BaconEggsRL","id":18596035,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4NTk2MDM1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18596035?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaconEggsRL","html_url":"https://github.com/BaconEggsRL","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaconEggsRL/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaconEggsRL/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaconEggsRL/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaconEggsRL/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaconEggsRL/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaconEggsRL/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaconEggsRL/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaconEggsRL/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaconEggsRL/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\nIn #124336, the change left the particle material uniform block assigned to binding 2, while C++ now binds it to binding 1.\r\n\r\n### Additional Details\r\nIn #124336, `drivers/gles3/storage/particles_storage.h‎` was updated, since the global shader parameters were moving into a texture and no longer needed a dedicated UBO:\r\n```\r\n enum ParticlesUniformLocation {\r\n     PARTICLES_FRAME_UNIFORM_LOCATION,\r\n-    PARTICLES_GLOBALS_UNIFORM_LOCATION,\r\n     PARTICLES_MATERIAL_UNIFORM_LOCATION,\r\n };\r\n```\r\nAs a result of this change, the `PARTICLES_MATERIAL_UNIFORM_LOCATION` binding was changed from 2 to 1.\r\n\r\nThe PR correctly removed the global uniform buffer in `‎drivers/gles3/shaders/particles.glsl`:\r\n```\r\n-layout(std140) uniform GlobalShaderUniformData { //ubo:1\r\n-    vec4 global_shader_uniforms[MAX_GLOBAL_SHADER_UNIFORMS];\r\n-};\r\n+uniform highp sampler2D global_shader_parameters_texture; //texunit:-2\r\n```\r\nHowever, the UBO binding for the material uniform was left unchanged:\r\n```\r\n#ifdef MATERIAL_UNIFORMS_USED\r\nlayout(std140) uniform MaterialUniforms{ //ubo:2\r\n\r\n#MATERIAL_UNIFORMS\r\n\r\n};\r\n#endif\r\n```\r\n\r\n\r\n## Summary of changes\r\nIn `drivers\\gles3\\shaders\\particles.glsl`, Change this line from:\r\n```layout(std140) uniform MaterialUniforms{ //ubo:2```\r\nTo:\r\n```layout(std140) uniform MaterialUniforms{ //ubo:1```\r\n\r\n## AI Usage Disclosure\r\nChatGPT assisted with investigation and analysis.\r\nTesting was done by a human. No agents were used.\r\n\r\n## Related Issues\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124336 -- The PR that introduced the uniform-binding regression.\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/112926 -- Separate SDF collision bug that requires this fix.\r\n\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1332303119,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzMyMzAzMTE5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/regression","name":"regression","description":"","color":"ff63ac","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","number":25,"state":"open","title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":345,"closed_issues":2336,"created_at":"2026-04-13T15:59:35Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T08:21:32Z","closed_at":null,"due_on":null},"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-10-14T18:20:30Z","updated_at":"2026-10-